Fixes from the 2026-10-30 review (already applied in utils/colore_cls.py):
  1. The photo-z draw uses a seeded generator (seed=0), so the gg and kg runs select the SAME galaxies
     (identical sample, shot noise and n(z)).
  2. Knox variance of a cross-spectrum: [C_kg^2 + (C_kk+N_kk)(C_gg+N_gg)] / ((2l+1) fsky); cl_ss already contains N_gg.

--- a/utils/colore_cls.py
+++ b/utils/colore_cls.py
@@ -111,7 +111,8 @@
